/meta/repository/url must be a credential-free HTTP(S) or Git SSH repository address without query, fragment, or dot segments.
[repository-evidence/url-invalid] /meta/repository/url must be a credential-free HTTP(S) or Git SSH repository address without query, fragment, or dot segments. Fix: run `git remote get-url origin` inside --repo-root and declare that credential-free address; use link_mode: local-only for internal repositories.
